  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d4ec7e9c341cb6d4eb3d16929581b578, type: 3}
  questDescription: Villagers, the flood is coming and this is the last millstone!
    It must never break, the sturdiest ever, and shield the mill from harm, as safe
    as possible! Grind properly with less effort, a tiny bit quicker, and quite lucky!
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 3
  - type: 4
    tier: 2
  - type: 6
    tier: 3
  - type: 2
    tier: 1
  - type: 5
    tier: 2
  successText: The mill stands, the flood is gone, and there is bread for all! You
    saved the village!
  partialText: The mill still turns, barely. We will survive the winter. Maybe.
  failureText: The flood took the mill! Everything is flour! Everything!
